stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state admission <<choice>>
    [*] --> admission: Eligible enrollment request
    admission --> ENROLLED: Seat available after older eligible waiters
    admission --> WAITLISTED: No seat available
    WAITLISTED --> ENROLLED: Promotion while course is published
    WAITLISTED --> CANCELLED: Student withdraws or course is archived
    ENROLLED --> CANCELLED: Student withdraws
    ENROLLED --> COMPLETED: Authorized manager records completion
    CANCELLED --> admission: Reapply with a new queue timestamp
